WEBVTT

00:01:59.907 --> 00:02:06.164
The list of health effects from heat
and from heat waves is long,

00:02:06.205 --> 00:02:12.086
and it includes significant
mental problems,

00:02:12.128 --> 00:02:13.671
mental health problems.

00:02:13.713 --> 00:02:15.173
It also,

00:02:15.214 --> 00:02:20.553
heat creates fatigue and loss of sleep,

00:02:20.595 --> 00:02:24.849
which in turn increases workplace injuries

00:02:24.891 --> 00:02:27.894
as well as significant
losses of productivity.

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:30.980
Heat waves also, we know,